  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬의 타입에 대해\n저는 한 가지 결론에 도달하게 됐어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7580020D0C0C785C5D00020B300D574000AC800B2940020D55C0020AC00C9C00020ACB0B860C5D00020B3C4B2ECD558AC8C0020B410C5B4C694002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "노말타입이야말로\n최강이라는 결론에요!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B178B9D0D0C0C785C774C57CB9D0B85C000ACD5CAC15C774B77CB2940020ACB0B860C5D0C6940021002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "노말타입은 불리한 타입이 거의 없어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B178B9D0D0C0C785C7400020BD88B9ACD55C0020D0C0C785C7740020AC70C7580020C5C6C5B4C694002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "즉, 상대를 가리지 않고\n싸울 수 있다는 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C989002C0020C0C1B300B97C0020AC00B9ACC9C00020C54AACE0000AC2F8C6B80020C2180020C788B2E4B2940020AC70C608C694002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다양한 지방을 여행하며\n다양한 포켓몬과 싸워 온<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n제가 하는 말이니까 틀림없어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C591D55C0020C9C0BC29C7440020C5ECD589D558BA70000AB2E4C591D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020C2F8C6CC0020C62800100001BE00000AC81CAC000020D558B2940020B9D0C774B2C8AE4C0020D2C0B9BCC5C6C5B4C694002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "못 믿으시겠다면, 승부를 통해\n노말타입 최강설을 확인시켜 드리죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BABB0020BBFFC73CC2DCACA0B2E4BA74002C0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D1B5D574000AB178B9D0D0C0C7850020CD5CAC15C124C7440020D655C778C2DCCF1C0020B4DCB9ACC8E0002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비가 되면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44AC000020B418BA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "노말타입 최강설을 확인시켜 드리죠!\n승부할 준비는 되셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B178B9D0D0C0C7850020CD5CAC15C124C7440020D655C778C2DCCF1C0020B4DCB9ACC8E00021000AC2B9BD80D5600020C900BE44B2940020B418C168B098C694003F00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비됐어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44B410C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아직이에요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C9C1C774C5D0C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "철저히 준비해 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CCA0C800D7880020C900BE44D5740020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 포켓몬은 모두 노말타입!\n어떤 타입을 상대하든 이길 수 있을 겁니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D3ECCF13BAACC7400020BAA8B4500020B178B9D0D0C0C7850021000AC5B4B5A40020D0C0C785C7440020C0C1B300D558B4E00020C774AE380020C2180020C788C7440020AC81B2C8B2E4002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 상성이 유리한 타입을\n추구해야 하는 걸까요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020C0C1C131C7740020C720B9ACD55C0020D0C0C785C744000ACD94AD6CD574C57C0020D558B2940020AC78AE4CC694002E002E002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만 저는 사실...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020C800B2940020C0ACC2E4002E002E002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "타입 상성이 전혀 외워지지 않는다구요!\n조합이 너무 많잖아요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0C0C7850020C0C1C131C7740020C804D6000020C678C6CCC9C0C9C00020C54AB294B2E4AD6CC6940021000AC870D569C7740020B108BB340020B9CEC796C544C694002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신은 타입 상성을\n완벽하게 외우고 있나요!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7400020D0C0C7850020C0C1C131C744000AC644BCBDD558AC8C0020C678C6B0ACE00020C788B098C6940021003F00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "외우고 있어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C678C6B0ACE00020C788C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니요...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8C694002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대단한 트레이너시군요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B2E8D55C0020D2B8B808C774B108C2DCAD70C694002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 다들 그렇군요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020B2E4B4E40020ADF8B807AD70C694002E002E002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 저는 노말타입 한 우물만 파겠어요!\n최강은 아니더라도 만능일 테니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020C800B2940020B178B9D0D0C0C7850020D55C0020C6B0BB3CB9CC0020D30CACA0C5B4C6940021000ACD5CAC15C7400020C544B2C8B354B77CB3C40020B9CCB2A5C77C0020D14CB2C8AE4CC694002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론 노말타입 기술이\n전혀 통하지 않는 타입도 있지만요...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n바로 고스트타입이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB8600020B178B9D0D0C0C7850020AE30C220C774000AC804D6000020D1B5D558C9C00020C54AB2940020D0C0C785B3C40020C788C9C0B9CCC694002E002E002E00100001BE00000ABC14B85C0020ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785C774C5D0C694002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "노말타입 기술이\n고스트타입에게도 통하기만 하면...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n상대가 누구든 싸울 수 있을 텐데!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B178B9D0D0C0C7850020AE30C220C774000AACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785C5D0AC8CB3C40020D1B5D558AE30B9CC0020D558BA74002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC0C1B300AC000020B204AD6CB4E00020C2F8C6B80020C2180020C788C7440020D150B370002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
